# 🎬 Azure Netflix DevOps Platform

### 🚀 Infrastructure as Code | Microsoft Azure | Terraform | Azure DevOps CI/CD

A Netflix-inspired frontend demo deployed on Microsoft Azure, supported by modular Terraform infrastructure and an Azure DevOps pipeline workflow.

This project demonstrates how cloud infrastructure can be provisioned and managed using **Infrastructure as Code (IaC)**, with version control, automated validation, Terraform planning, and a pull-request-based deployment process.

The primary goal is to build practical DevOps skills by implementing a repeatable, maintainable, and controlled infrastructure deployment workflow.

