## 🔮 Future Improvements

The project can be extended with the following enhancements:

- 🐳 Containerize the frontend application using Docker.
- 📦 Publish application images to Azure Container Registry.
- 🔄 Automate application deployment and updates through a dedicated CI/CD pipeline.
- 🌐 Configure a custom domain and HTTPS.
- 🛡️ Add an Azure Application Gateway or another suitable entry-point security layer.
- 🔍 Integrate additional security and code-quality checks into pull-request validation.
- 📊 Add monitoring, logging, and health checks.
- 🏗️ Extend the architecture toward a more secure multi-tier deployment where appropriate.
- 🤖 Explore GitHub Actions as an additional CI/CD implementation.

These are planned enhancements, not claims that every feature is already implemented.

